#: ../../learn/installation.rst:2
msgid "Install Zett Agent"
msgstr "安装 Zett Agent"

#: ../../learn/installation.rst
msgid "pip"
msgstr "pip"

#: ../../learn/installation.rst
msgid "uv"
msgstr "uv"

#: ../../learn/installation.rst:18
msgid "Zett Agent requires Python 3.10 or newer; continuous integration covers 3.10 through 3.14. The library needs no Node.js and no external service to run. Every built-in provider is a package dependency, so there are no extras to install."
msgstr "Zett Agent 需要 Python 3.10 或更高版本,持续集成覆盖 3.10 到 3.14。运行这个库不需要 Node.js,也不依赖任何外部服务。所有内置的模型提供商都是包依赖,因此无需额外安装可选依赖。"

#: ../../learn/installation.rst:23
msgid "Verify the install"
msgstr "验证安装"

#: ../../learn/installation.rst:30
msgid "Run something immediately"
msgstr "立即运行一个示例"

#: ../../learn/installation.rst:32
msgid ":doc:`first-agent` is a complete program with a deterministic model, so it needs no API key and makes no network request. It runs the real loop — messages, streaming and session history — with a scripted model in place of a provider. Try :doc:`../examples/streaming-tools` next for a complete tool round trip."
msgstr ":doc:`first-agent`\\ 是一个完整的程序,使用确定性的模型,因此不需要 API 密钥,也不会发出任何网络请求。它用一个预设脚本的模型代替模型提供商,运行真实的循环:消息、流式输出和会话历史。接下来可以试试\\ :doc:`../examples/streaming-tools`,体验一次完整的工具往返。"

#: ../../learn/installation.rst:38
msgid "Work from a checkout"
msgstr "从源码检出目录开始"

#: ../../learn/installation.rst:40
msgid "To read and modify the source, clone the repository and let ``uv`` create the environment:"
msgstr "想阅读和修改源码,可以克隆仓库,让 ``uv`` 创建环境:"

#: ../../learn/installation.rst:50
msgid "Use ``uv run python your_script.py`` to run code against the checkout instead of an installed release."
msgstr "用 ``uv run python your_script.py`` 对检出的源码运行代码,而不是使用已安装的发布版本。"

#: ../../learn/installation.rst:55
msgid "Providers and storage you create are yours to close. Call ``await model.aclose()`` and ``await storage.close()`` when finished."
msgstr "你自己创建的模型提供商和存储需要由你自己关闭。使用完毕后请调用 ``await model.aclose()`` 和 ``await storage.close()``\\ 。"

#: ../../learn/installation.rst:58
msgid "Next: :doc:`first-agent`."
msgstr "下一步:\\ :doc:`first-agent`\\ 。"

